{"title":"1998 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 1b","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1998 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/a/9daa8569bfb84c8f95fdd641e8d63369f4c33b30.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{2x - 4} = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"76\" height=\"17\" />, what is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/4/f84a8ef42bdc8f0bcb4de358245db0d2598412da.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{2x - 4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"43\" height=\"17\" /> to be equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/1/f0121615fbc873b1250b8244550ffb0754d6563d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x - 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"53\" height=\"15\" /> must be equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. We then have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/a/d9a95c4cecb8c983ba76c1aedfe05432e55b99b0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x = 3 + 4 = 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"119\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/b/c5b643c0623b05fcb9dc8f16fabb2a7f740d82bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\boxed{\\frac{7}{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"61\" height=\"49\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017191446\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.009 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.014 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 38/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 78/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1432/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.972      1 1998_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1\n100.00%    5.972      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:36589:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017191446 and revision id 282341. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}